#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Apollo Mission Control Visual Avionics & Theme Configurator
Unified GUI for:
  1) Mission Theme Profiles (NASA, CRT-Amber, CRT-Green, Kosmos-VFD)
  2) Per-Theme Wallpaper Matrix & Dynamic In-Theme Cycler
  3) 8-Bit Orbital Screensaver & Idle Lockscreen Avionics
  4) Waybar Menubar Module Visibility Matrix & Live Rebuild
Strict Zero-White-Background Policy across all 4 space mission themes.
"""
